content:
Help me find the associations.  

#### Data:
These are the extracted domain objects and their associations:
```json
{
  "domain objects": [
    {
      "name": "Cinema Manager",
      "description": "Oversees film scheduling, staffing approvals, and performance data."
    },
    {
      "name": "Auditorium",
      "description": "A theater room where films are shown.",
      "attributes": [
        "Film",
        "Equipment"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Screening",
      "description": "A scheduled showing of a film.",
      "attributes": [
        "Film",
        "Attendance"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Film",
      "description": "A movie selected and scheduled for screening."
    },
    {
      "name": "Attendance",
      "description": "Recorded number of visitors for a screening."
    },
    {
      "name": "Equipment",
      "description": "Technical hardware supporting film projection."
    },
    {
      "name": "Staffing Plan",
      "description": "Assignment of staff to stations for a shift.",
      "attributes": [
        "Ticket Station",
        "Concession Station"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Shift Supervisor",
      "description": "Prepares screening schedules and assigns staff."
    },
    {
      "name": "Screening Schedule",
      "description": "A timetable listing screenings for projection operations.",
      "attributes": [
        "Screening"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Ticket Station",
      "description": "Workstation where ticketing clerks sell tickets.",
      "attributes": [
        "Ticketing Clerk"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Ticketing Clerk",
      "description": "Sells tickets and processes refunds."
    },
    {
      "name": "Operational Issue Report",
      "description": "A record of problems encountered during a shift."
    },
    {
      "name": "Projectionist",
      "description": "Runs the projection system and ensures smooth screenings."
    },
    {
      "name": "Projection System",
      "description": "The system used to load and project films.",
      "attributes": [
        "Film"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Equipment Malfunction Report",
      "description": "A report documenting faulty equipment."
    },
    {
      "name": "Concession Station",
      "description": "Workstation for selling snacks.",
      "attributes": [
        "Concession Clerk"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Concession Clerk",
      "description": "Handles snack sales and tracks inventory."
    },
    {
      "name": "Snack Inventory",
      "description": "Stock of snacks available at concession."
    },
    {
      "name": "Shortage Report",
      "description": "A record of items needing restocking."
    },
    {
      "name": "Procurement Team",
      "description": "Handles ordering supplies for the cinema."
    },
    {
      "name": "Ticket",
      "description": "Proof of entry for a screening.",
      "attributes": [
        "Screening"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Customer",
      "description": "A visitor purchasing tickets or requesting refunds."
    },
    {
      "name": "Refund Request",
      "description": "A customer-initiated request to refund a purchased ticket."
    }
  ]
}
```

#### Task:
- Draw connections between objects that have an association. 
- Name each object and add a description that captures the meaning of the association.
- Return the associations in json format. Here is an example for structuring the data:
```json
{
  "associations": [
    {
      "from": "...",
      "to": "...",
      "description": "..."
    }
  ]
}
```

Here are the associations:
```json
